'''Resident Undead''' (アンデッドハザード, ''Andeddo Hazādo'', '''Undead Hazard''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]]. It is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1. Each stage features [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie Enemies]] and has a [[Cat Capsule#Normal Cat Capsule|Cat Ticket]] as a reward.

==Event Information==
The Zombies have suddenly mutated and are holding the Cat Empire captive under an endless siege!<br>
Clear the stages, fight off the Zombies, and earn up to {{Color|#FF6D01|'''10 Cat Tickets'''}} from drop rewards!<br>
During this event, visit the Legend Stages from the Battle Cats title menu and select the {{Color|#0000FF|'''Resident Undead'''}} map under the Special Stages section to take on this challenge.<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between November 9th (11:00am) and November 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

Can your Cats destroy this new Zombie menace?!

※ After clearing a stage, there will be a short cooldown period before you are able to challenge the next stage.<br>
※ Spending a Catamin A will allow you to skip the stage cooldown period and challenge the next stage immediately.<br>
※ If the event does not appear, please make sure that you are updated to the latest version of the Battle Cats app.

